        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert web copywriter and SEO specialist. Create website page content for this site.\n\nBusiness type: {{ $json[\"Business Type\"] }}\nPages needed: {{ $json[\"Pages Needed\"] }}\nDesired tone: {{ $json[\"Tone\"] }}\n\nInstructions:\n- Produce exactly one entry for each page listed in \"Pages needed\".\n- For each page return: title (the page name), slug (lowercase, hyphenated, url-safe), and content.\n- content must be clean semantic HTML using only <h2>, <h3>, <p>, <ul>, <li>, <strong>, <em> tags. Do NOT wrap it in a code block or markdown.\n- Write substantive, specific copy tailored to the business type, in the requested tone. Avoid generic filler.\n- Do not use long dashes.\nReturn the result strictly matching the required JSON structure.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert web copywriter and SEO specialist. You generate clean, semantic HTML website page content and always return output strictly matching the required JSON structure (an array of pages, each with title, slug, and content)."
        }
